// PRESET TABLES ARE NOT im.quantization's ORDER. PIL/JpegPresets.py
// stores them in zigzag order while im.quantization is natural, and
// Pillow's _save hands both to libjpeg's jpeg_add_quant_table, which
// reads natural order. So a preset's table reaches libjpeg permuted,
// and matching Pillow means permuting it the same way: these lists
// go out exactly as Pillow's do, untouched.
